  "question": {
    "text": "The value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi></math>,&nbsp;so that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>,&nbsp;is",
